      "role": "user",
      "content": "The most concerning part is that the technicians say everything looks fine on the sensors, but the cooling just stopped out of nowhere. It’s like something just tripped the system or caused a sudden malfunction even though there's no obvious mechanical damage. What else could cause such a sudden, unexplainable failure in a unit like that?",
